/119261.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-07T16:16:40Z"},"body":"Contributes to #43440\r\n\r\nAdds unit tests for `TextureButton` covering:\r\n\r\n* Default property values (all texture slots, click mask, `ignore_texture_size`, `stretch_mode`, flip flags, `mouse_filter`, combined minimum size)\r\n* Set/get and clear for each texture slot, plus independent slots (`texture_normal` / `texture_pressed`, etc.)\r\n* Click mask set/get and clear\r\n* Combined minimum size priority (`texture_normal` over `texture_pressed` / `texture_hover`, `texture_pressed` when normal is empty, `texture_hover` when normal and pressed are empty, mask-only when no textures)\r\n* `ignore_texture_size` with a normal texture (combined minimum size stays zero)\r\n* All `StretchMode` enum values round-trip\r\n* `flip_h` / `flip_v` toggling and independence\r\n* `has_point` without a click mask (via `Control*`; `TextureButton` keeps `has_point` protected)\r\n* `has_point` with a click mask after `NOTIFICATION_DRAW`: default keep stretch, `STRETCH_SCALE`, `STRETCH_TILE` (including a second horizontal tile), and `STRETCH_KEEP_ASPECT_COVERED`\r\n\r\nAI disclosure: I designed the test plan, wrote every line, reviewed behavior, `has_point` access rules, and ran pre-commit and CI on my fork. Cursor helped with research and drafting.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"htt